[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/belakarkache/bg3-shared-actions/main/docs/media/cover.png[/img][/center]

[size=6][b]Shared Actions[/b][/size]

Use potions, scrolls, special arrows and throwable items carried by anyone in your party, straight from your Action Bar. The mod adds four buttons, [b]Take Potion[/b], [b]Use Scroll[/b], [b]Quiver[/b] and [b]Throw[/b], so you don't have to pass items between characters in the middle of a fight. [b]Quiver[/b] needs a bow or crossbow equipped and lists only special arrows, since regular ammo is unlimited.

[line]
[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/Norbyte/bg3se]BG3 Script Extender[/url]
[/list]

[line]
[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*][b]Back up your save.[/b] The mod adds spells that are saved with your game.
[*]Download the mod from [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/baldursgate3/mods/25804]Nexus Mods[/url] or [url=https://github.com/belakarkache/bg3-shared-actions/releases]GitHub Releases[/url].
[*]In [b]BG3 Mod Manager[/b], import the [font=Courier New].zip[/font], enable [b]Shared Actions[/b] and click [b]Export Load Order to Game[/b].
[*]Start the game. The new buttons are on the Action Bar.
[/list]

